{
  "key": "letter-103-part-01",
  "number": 103,
  "generationId": "01a1e633-c899-76e7-b593-3946716483f4",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1970-103/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.59873
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "I received your letter.",
      "path": "audio/1970-103/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.9712239999999999,
      "end": 3.276122
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "It is good to know that your mother's death has made you consider your own.",
      "path": "audio/1970-103/03.mp3",
      "start": 4.564172,
      "end": 8.146395
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "One has to go through the awareness of death to reach deathlessness.",
      "path": "audio/1970-103/04.mp3",
      "start": 9.502857,
      "end": 13.191813999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "The thrust of death goes deep but the mind cunningly goes on evading it.",
      "path": "audio/1970-103/05.mp3",
      "start": 14.598095,
      "end": 19.010907
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Don't evade it, don't console yourself - any kind of consolation is a suicide.",
      "path": "audio/1970-103/06.mp3",
      "start": 20.320657999999998,
      "end": 24.918163
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Let yourself feel the wound of death completely: wake up and live with it!",
      "path": "audio/1970-103/07.mp3",
      "start": 26.241497,
      "end": 30.915578
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "This will be hard but revolution always is.",
      "path": "audio/1970-103/08.mp3",
      "start": 32.225397,
      "end": 34.670635
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Death is, it is there always, but we forget about it.",
      "path": "audio/1970-103/09.mp3",
      "start": 35.911995000000005,
      "end": 39.563151999999995
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Every day death is there, every moment.",
      "path": "audio/1970-103/10.mp3",
      "start": 41.077347,
      "end": 44.3
    }
  ]
}
